from financial_manual_symbols import Review
r=Review('src/Falah.Domain/Orders/CheckoutRules.cs')
def a(l,c,reason,inputs,outputs,tests,refs,issues='No new promoted issue; static only.'):
 r.add(l,c,reason,inputs,outputs,'Pure calculation or validation exception; no state persisted.','No database access.','Inputs already carry server-resolved product prices, but delivery/discount/comp/payment fields remain caller-controlled; no actor available here.',tests,refs,performance='Linear list scans; bounded cart expected but no explicit count limit in this file.',issues=issues)
a(32,5,'Sums every item TotalPrice integer amount using LINQ long Sum then wraps Money; no price resolution or empty cart assertion here. Long Sum throws on overflow rather than silently wrapping, whereas item arithmetic may already overflow upstream. Empty list yields zero and null list fails.','OrderItem list','Money subtotal','Empty/null cart and sum overflow','BuildPlan92 calls; lambda33 reads item.TotalPrice.')
a(33,38,'Selector reads each item TotalPrice.Piastres without modifying quantity or price; correctness depends on server-priced items, not totals sent by a client. It deliberately has no per-item rounding because Money is integer piastres.','OrderItem','long piastres','Negative/overflow item total and quantity boundaries','ComputeSubtotal32 Sum selector33.')
a(35,5,'Adds delivery fee to tax-final cart then subtracts comp and floors any negative result to zero. It does not reject negative delivery fees: a negative fee equal to the cart reduces payable to zero even when discount/comp fields are zero. Handler permission checks concern those other fields only, so this is an independent pending authorization candidate, not approved free-sale behavior.','cart total, fee, comp','Nonnegative-looking Money unless arithmetic overflow','Negative fee, comp exceeding cart, long arithmetic limits','BuildPlan97; handler66,112,116,142; Money operators31-34.','NEGATIVE_DELIVERY_FEE_BYPASSES_PRICE_REDUCTION_PERMISSIONS candidate; independent challenge requested.')
a(44,5,'Cash-on-delivery is true only for Delivery plus Cash plus strictly positive payable. Zero-price delivery is immediately non-COD, avoiding phantom driver custody. Other payment methods and pickup never defer as COD through this predicate.','OrderType/PaymentMethod/payable','Boolean','Delivery cash0 vs1; PickupCash; negative total','BuildPlan99; DefersAllMoney68.')
a(50,5,'Standalone InstaPay/Wallet creates one Pending electronic payment for full payable. Multi scans for any electronic leg then selects only first; no rejection of a second distinct electronic method occurs here or in FinancialRules. One pending object cannot represent both InstaPay and Wallet independently. Wallet provider retained only for Wallet. Empty/non-electronic Multi returns null.','method/total/splits/provider','Nullable ElectronicPayment','Cash+InstaPay+Wallet allocation, reversed leg order, zero standalone electronic','BuildPlan100; Any58/First60; AssertSplitPaymentAllocation13-24.','Multi-two-electronic representation lead; FIN001 currently blocks mixed confirmation anyway; do not count duplicate confirmed loss.')
a(58,51,'Tests whether a split method equals either supported electronic channel. Ignores amount because subsequent allocation validation checks positivity; malformed split may instantiate pending object before validation throws but no external side effect occurs.','PaymentSplit','Boolean electronic membership','Both electronic methods, cash/card and invalid enum','SelectElectronicLeg58 Any; FinancialRules16 positive guard.')
a(60,44,'First selector uses same method predicate as preceding Any, so non-mutated list cannot throw for absent match. Caller mutable IReadOnlyList alias could change between enumerations, but no concurrency exploit established. Multiple electronic methods deterministically retain first only.','PaymentSplit','Boolean first-match criterion','Reordered electronic legs and mutation alias','SelectElectronicLeg60 First guarded by58 Any.')
a(68,5,'No-positive-total or COD always defers all posting; standalone pending electronic also defers. Positive Multi returns false even if all its legs are electronic, causing Checkout handler to reserve and complete sale key although each electronic leg is skipped. Confirm later needs same key: FIN001 journal collision, including all-electronic Multi.','payable/COD/electronic/method','Boolean money deferral','All-electronic Multi, mixed immediate/electronic, zero total','CheckoutHandler149-154 and275; ConfirmHandler82-87.','FIN001 independently corroborated; not runtime reproduced.')
a(77,5,'Paid is true precisely when neither COD nor pending electronic object exists. Zero Cash order therefore paid while zero InstaPay still pending; no positivity or actual tender validation here. Multi with any electronic leg remains unpaid until separate confirmation handles it.','COD/electronic leg','Boolean paid','Zero Cash vs electronic, pending mixed','BuildPlan109; Order.Create consumes plan.')
a(84,5,'BuildPlan validates Multi presence, computes server item subtotal less discount with zero taxable floor, applies tax then fee/comp, derives COD and single electronic state. Non-COD tender must cover total even when electronic is deferred; split exact allocation checked afterwards. It never checks negative fee, discount or comp, cart emptiness or actor permissions. Change is nonnegative tender-minus-total. No external writes before thrown validation.','Order/payment/cart/monetary fields/tax/splits/provider','CheckoutPlan or DomainException','Negative fee authorization, two electronic channels, overdiscount, split zero/duplicate, COD tender','Calls32,35,44,50,68,77 and FinancialRules13; handler142.','Pending negative-fee and two-electronic leads; FIN001 deferral conflict; no new promotion.')
a(129,5,'Missing requested time returns without order-type validation. Present time requires Pickup then inclusive five-minute past grace and fourteen-day future limit relative to supplied now. Strict less/greater means exact boundaries accepted; DateTimeOffset compares instants independent of offset. Caller obtains current UTC, no restaurant opening-hours policy inferred.','type/nullable requested/now','Void or DomainException','Exact +/- bounds, nonPickup time, null, timezone offsets','Handler100 invokes; PickupGracePeriod123 and MaxPickupLeadTime119.')
